Input: {"question": "What position does Florence Bagnard currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 78, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Florence Bagnard Makes History as First Female Prefect of Lozère"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 80, "end": 288, "text": "**MENDE, LOZÈRE -** In a milestone moment for French politics, Florence Bagnard has been appointed as the new Prefect of Lozère, becoming the first woman to hold the esteemed position in the region's history."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 289, "end": 522, "text": "The 45-year-old politician, known for her tireless advocacy on rural development and environmental issues, was officially sworn in yesterday at a ceremony attended by local dignitaries and officials from the Ministry of the Interior."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 523, "end": 656, "text": "\"I am deeply honored to take on this role and serve the people of Lozère,\" Bagnard said in an exclusive interview with our newspaper."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 657, "end": 858, "text": "\"As a native of this region, I understand the unique challenges we face, and I am committed to working tirelessly to promote economic growth, improve public services, and protect our natural heritage.\""}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 859, "end": 988, "text": "Bagnard's appointment has been widely welcomed by local residents, who see her as a breath of fresh air in the region's politics."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 989, "end": 1104, "text": "\"Florence has always been a champion of our community,\" said Pierre Roussel, mayor of the nearby town of Marvejols."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1105, "end": 1217, "text": "\"Her dedication to our region's development is unmatched, and we have no doubt she will excel in this new role.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1218, "end": 1399, "text": "As Prefect of Lozère, Bagnard will be responsible for overseeing the region's administrative services, ensuring public safety, and implementing national policies at the local level."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1400, "end": 1528, "text": "Her priorities, she said, will include revitalizing rural areas, supporting small businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1529, "end": 1736, "text": "According to data from the Ministry of the Interior, Lozère has seen a significant decline in population over the past decade, with many young people leaving the region in search of better job opportunities."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1737, "end": 1854, "text": "Bagnard's appointment is seen as a key step in reversing this trend and injecting new life into the region's economy."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1855, "end": 2054, "text": "\"Florence's appointment is a testament to the government's commitment to promoting diversity and inclusion in our public institutions,\" said Minister of the Interior, Gérald Darmanin, in a statement."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2055, "end": 2179, "text": "\"We have every confidence that she will excel in this role and make a positive impact on the lives of the people of Lozère.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2180, "end": 2367, "text": "Bagnard's inauguration ceremony was attended by over 200 guests, including local officials, business leaders, and representatives from the region's agricultural and environmental sectors."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 16, "text": "Florence Bagnard"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 18, "end": 213, "text": "Florence Bagnard is a French politician who currently holds the position of conseiller municipal de Givry, a member of the municipal council of Givry, a commune in the Yonne department in France."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 214, "end": 235, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 237, "end": 320, "text": "There is limited information available on Florence Bagnard's early life and career."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 321, "end": 432, "text": "However, it is known that she is a resident of Givry and has been involved in local politics for several years."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 433, "end": 449, "text": "Political Career"}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 451, "end": 548, "text": "Florence Bagnard's political career is marked by her election as a conseiller municipal de Givry."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 549, "end": 710, "text": "As a member of the municipal council, she is responsible for making decisions on local issues, such as urban planning, transportation, and community development."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 711, "end": 743, "text": "Evidence of Holding the Position"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 745, "end": 866, "text": "According to the official website of the commune of Givry, Florence Bagnard is listed as a conseiller municipal de Givry."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 867, "end": 1015, "text": "[1] This information is also corroborated by local news sources, which have reported on her involvement in municipal council meetings and decisions."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1016, "end": 1019, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1021, "end": 1169, "text": "In addition, the Yonne department's official website lists Florence Bagnard as a conseiller municipal de Givry, further substantiating her position."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1170, "end": 1173, "text": "[3]"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1175, "end": 1185, "text": "References"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1187, "end": 1208, "text": "[1] Commune of Givry."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1209, "end": 1216, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1217, "end": 1235, "text": "Conseil municipal."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1236, "end": 1296, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.givry.fr\\/conseil-municipal\\/>"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1298, "end": 1324, "text": "[2] Le Journal de l'Yonne."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1325, "end": 1345, "text": "(2020, February 10)."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1346, "end": 1396, "text": "Givry: Le conseil municipal valide le budget 2020."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1397, "end": 1509, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.lejournaldelyonne.fr\\/givry-2020-02-10-le-conseil-municipal-valide-le-budget-2020>"}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1511, "end": 1532, "text": "[3] Yonne Department."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1533, "end": 1540, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1541, "end": 1580, "text": "Les élus du conseil municipal de Givry."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Prefect of Lozère", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Florence Bagnard", "scope": "current", "claim": "Florence Bagnard has been appointed as the new Prefect of Lozère.", "answer": "Prefect of Lozère", "quote": "**MENDE, LOZÈRE -** In a milestone moment for French politics, Florence Bagnard has been appointed as the new Prefect of Lozère, becoming the first woman to hold the esteemed position in the region's history. The 45-year-old politician, known for her tireless advocacy on rural development and environmental issues, was officially sworn in yesterday at a ceremony attended by local dignitaries and officials from the Ministry of the Interior. \"I am deeply honored to take on this role and serve the people of Lozère,\" Bagnard said in an exclusive interview with our newspaper. \"As a native of this region, I understand the unique challenges we face, and I am committed to working tirelessly to promote economic growth, improve public services, and protect our natural heritage.\" Bagnard's appointment has been widely welcomed by local residents, who see her as a breath of fresh air in the region's politics. \"Florence has always been a champion of our community,\" said Pierre Roussel, mayor of the nearby town of Marvejols. \"Her dedication to our region's development is unmatched, and we have no doubt she will excel in this new role.\" As Prefect of Lozère, Bagnard will be responsible for overseeing the region's administrative services, ensuring public safety, and implementing national policies at the local level.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Prefect of Lozère", "conseiller municipal de Givry"]}
